#: ../../src/async.rst:5
msgid ":c:type:`uv_async_t` --- Async handle"
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_async_t` —— Async 句柄"

#: ../../src/async.rst:7
msgid ""
"Async handles allow the user to \"wakeup\" the event loop and get a "
"callback called from another thread."
msgstr "Async 句柄允许用户从另一个线程“唤醒”事件循环并使回调被调用。"

#: ../../src/async.rst:12
msgid ""
":c:func:`uv_async_send` and the :c:type:`uv_async_cb` invocation are "
"sequentially consistent (seq_cst) operations for a given async handle: "
"all memory accesses (reads and writes) made before "
":c:func:`uv_async_send` are visible to that callback."
msgstr ""
"对于给定的 async 句柄，:c:func:`uv_async_send` 与 :c:type:`uv_async_cb` "
"的调用是顺序一致（seq_cst）的操作：在 :c:func:`uv_async_send` 之前发生的"
"所有内存访问（读与写）对该回调均可见。"

#: ../../src/async.rst:18
msgid ""
"libuv will coalesce calls to :c:func:`uv_async_send`, that is, not every "
"call to it will yield an execution of the callback. For example: if "
":c:func:`uv_async_send` is called 5 times in a row before the callback is"
" called, the callback will only be called once. If "
":c:func:`uv_async_send` is called again after the callback was called, it"
" will be called again. However, since it is sequentially consistent, the "
"values read or written in that callback will always be the same (or "
"newer) as those read or written by the other thread."
msgstr ""
"libuv 会合并对 :c:func:`uv_async_send` 的调用，也就是说，并非每次调用都会"
"使回调执行一次。例如：如果在回调被调用之前连续调用 :c:func:"
"`uv_async_send` 5 次，回调只会被调用一次。如果在回调被调用之后再次调用 "
":c:func:`uv_async_send`，回调会再次被调用。不过，由于这是顺序一致的，在"
"该回调中读或写的值，将始终与另一个线程所读或写的值相同（或更新）。"

#: ../../src/async.rst:27
msgid ""
":c:func:`uv_async_send` and :c:type:`uv_async_cb` are sequentially "
"consistent. Prior to this version, any case where libuv might coalesce "
"calls probably requires a full `seq_cst` fence before it for correctness."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`uv_async_send` 与 :c:type:`uv_async_cb` 是顺序一致的。在此版本之"
"前，凡是 libuv 可能合并调用的场合，为保证正确性，多半需要在其前面加一道完"
"整的 `seq_cst` 栅栏。"

#: ../../src/async.rst:34
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/async.rst:38
msgid "Async handle type."
msgstr "Async 句柄类型。"

#: ../../src/async.rst:42
msgid "Type definition for callback passed to :c:func:`uv_async_init`."
msgstr "传递给 :c:func:`uv_async_init` 的回调的类型定义。"

#: ../../src/async.rst:46
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/async.rst:48
msgid "N/A"
msgstr "无"

#: ../../src/async.rst:50
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` members also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的成员也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/async.rst:54
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/async.rst:58
msgid "Initialize the handle. A NULL callback is allowed."
msgstr "初始化句柄。允许回调为 NULL。"

#: ../../src/async.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr "返回"

#: ../../src/async.rst:60 ../../src/async.rst:69
msgid "0 on success, or an error code < 0 on failure."
msgstr "成功时返回 0，失败时返回小于 0 的错误码。"

#: ../../src/async.rst:63
msgid ""
"Unlike other handle initialization  functions, it immediately starts the "
"handle."
msgstr "与其他句柄初始化函数不同，它会立即启动该句柄。"

#: ../../src/async.rst:67
msgid "Wake up the event loop and call the async handle's callback."
msgstr "唤醒事件循环，并调用该 async 句柄的回调。"

#: ../../src/async.rst:72
msgid ""
"It's safe to call this function from any thread. The callback will be "
"called on the loop thread."
msgstr "从任何线程调用此函数都是安全的。回调会在循环线程上被调用。"

#: ../../src/async.rst:76
msgid ""
":c:func:`uv_async_send` is `async-signal-safe <https://man7.org/linux"
"/man-pages/man7/signal-safety.7.html>`_. It's safe to call this function "
"from a signal handler."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`uv_async_send` 是 `async-signal-safe <https://man7.org/linux/"
"man-pages/man7/signal-safety.7.html>`_ 的。从信号处理函数中调用此函数是安"
"全的。"

#: ../../src/async.rst:80
msgid ""
"This is a full memory fence with respect to other calls and callbacks "
"using this same async handle, and so it will order all operations around "
"this call and the corresponding callback on the sending thread and "
"receiving thread."
msgstr ""
"相对于使用同一 async 句柄的其他调用和回调，这是一道完整的内存栅栏，因此它"
"会对发送线程与接收线程上围绕此次调用及相应回调的所有操作进行排序。"

#: ../../src/async.rst:86
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` API functions also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的 API 函数也同样适用。"
